  "sentence_method": "one complete sentence per generation",
  "word_method": "independent word generation, not extracted from sentence audio",
  "sentences": [
    {
      "id": 1,
      "text": "Have you ever imagined the life in space?",
      "file": "assets/audio/sentences/sentence-01.mp3",
      "exists": true
    },
    {
      "id": 2,
      "text": "The following will show you the astronauts' daily life.",
      "file": "assets/audio/sentences/sentence-02.mp3",
      "exists": true
    },
    {
      "id": 3,
      "text": "Eating in space",
      "file": "assets/audio/sentences/sentence-03.mp3",
      "exists": true
    },
    {
      "id": 4,
      "text": "Some foods can be eaten in their natural forms, such as chocolate cakes and bananas.",
      "file": "assets/audio/sentences/sentence-04.mp3",
      "exists": true
    },
    {
      "id": 5,
      "text": "Other foods require adding water, such as cheese.",
      "file": "assets/audio/sentences/sentence-05.mp3",
      "exists": true
    },
    {
      "id": 6,
      "text": "Of course, an oven is provided at the space station to heat the food.",
      "file": "assets/audio/sentences/sentence-06.mp3",
      "exists": true
    },
    {
      "id": 7,
      "text": "But there are no fridges, so space food must be kept properly.",
      "file": "assets/audio/sentences/sentence-07.mp3",
      "exists": true
    },
    {
      "id": 8,
      "text": "Astronauts can never be careless with their food storage.",
      "file": "assets/audio/sentences/sentence-08.mp3",
      "exists": true
    },
    {
      "id": 9,
      "text": "Sleeping in space",
      "file": "assets/audio/sentences/sentence-09.mp3",
      "exists": true
    },
    {
      "id": 10,
      "text": "Astronauts go to bed at a certain time, then get up and prepare for work again.",
      "file": "assets/audio/sentences/sentence-10.mp3",
      "exists": true
    },
    {
      "id": 11,
      "text": "They might set their alarm clocks to wake up at 6 a.m.",
      "file": "assets/audio/sentences/sentence-11.mp3",
      "exists": true
    },
    {
      "id": 12,
      "text": "When going to sleep, they have to attach themselves, so they don't float around or hit their bodies against something.",
      "file": "assets/audio/sentences/sentence-12.mp3",
      "exists": true
    },
    {
      "id": 13,
      "text": "They usually use sleeping bags located in small crew cabins.",
      "file": "assets/audio/sentences/sentence-13.mp3",
      "exists": true
    },
    {
      "id": 14,
      "text": "Each crew cabin is like a tiny apartment just big enough for one person.",
      "file": "assets/audio/sentences/sentence-14.mp3",
      "exists": true
    },
    {
      "id": 15,
      "text": "Exercise is an important part of every astronaut's daily life to prevent muscle loss.",
      "file": "assets/audio/sentences/sentence-15.mp3",
      "exists": true
    },
    {
      "id": 16,
      "text": "Usually, astronauts exercise two hours every day.",
      "file": "assets/audio/sentences/sentence-16.mp3",
      "exists": true
    },
    {
      "id": 17,
      "text": "They might use a special gym with exercise machines.",
      "file": "assets/audio/sentences/sentence-17.mp3",
      "exists": true
    },
    {
      "id": 18,
      "text": "Lifting 200 pounds on Earth may be a lot of work, but it would be much easier in space.",
      "file": "assets/audio/sentences/sentence-18.mp3",
      "exists": true
    },
    {
      "id": 19,
      "text": "That means the things for exercise need to be specially designed, so astronauts can receive the exercise needed to stay fit.",
      "file": "assets/audio/sentences/sentence-19.mp3",
      "exists": true
    },
    {
      "id": 20,
      "text": "Living in space is not just all work and no play.",
      "file": "assets/audio/sentences/sentence-20.mp3",
      "exists": true
    },
    {
      "id": 21,
      "text": "Astronauts have fun too.",
      "file": "assets/audio/sentences/sentence-21.mp3",
      "exists": true
    },
    {
      "id": 22,
      "text": "They might take photos of Earth or write in their diaries.",
      "file": "assets/audio/sentences/sentence-22.mp3",
      "exists": true
    },
    {
      "id": 23,
      "text": "Fun plays an important role in the quality of their lives.",
      "file": "assets/audio/sentences/sentence-23.mp3",
      "exists": true
    }
  ],
